--- !u!114 &-5726251094577984535
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3882272147560746744}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a95c4c57c6ad7e148af453bbd57a6e52, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialogue:
  - "You\u2019re up late again, Lyra. Shouldn\u2019t you be resting like the others?"
  - "(Smiling) I could say the same to you. But I doubt you\u2019d listen if I told
    you to sleep."
  - "Sharpening my blade is different. A dull sword can\u2019t protect anyone."
  - (Laughing softly) You sound like the oldest soldier in the kingdom. Always with
    the same excuse.
  - "It\u2019s not an excuse. It\u2019s preparation."
  - (Sitting down beside him) And what happens when preparation wears you down? Even
    steel breaks, Darius.
  - "(Shrugs) Then I\u2019ll keep reforging it. That\u2019s the only way to survive
    out here."
  - "(Shaking her head) Surviving and living are not the same thing. You can\u2019t
    carry the weight of the world alone."
  - (Looking at her) Someone has to.
  - "(Quietly) Not alone. We\u2019re here for each other, remember? A party isn\u2019t
    just for sharing loot."
  - "(Smirks slightly) You\u2019re quick to remind me of that when we split the gold."
  - "(Laughing) Someone has to keep you honest! But in all seriousness, Darius...
    you can lean on us, too. You don\u2019t have to act like you\u2019re invincible."
  - "(Pauses, then sighs) Maybe you\u2019re right. It\u2019s just... easier to keep
    moving forward without thinking about it."
  - "(Smiling warmly) That\u2019s what I\u2019m here for. To remind you to stop,
    breathe, and maybe enjoy the stars once in a while."
  - (Looks up briefly) They are bright tonight.
  - "See? That wasn\u2019t so hard, was it?"
  - "(Chuckling softly) You\u2019re relentless."
  - "And you\u2019re stubborn. It\u2019s why we make such a good team."
  - (Glancing at her) You really think that?
  - (Sincerely) I know that. And I know that none of us would be here without you.
  - (Looks away, his voice quieter) Thanks, Lyra.
  - "(Standing up) Anytime. Now, try to get some rest. That\u2019s an order."
  - "(Smiling faintly) Yes, ma\u2019am."
  _skipInterval: 0.1
  _charNames:
  - Darius
  - Lyra
  _avatars:
